    "domainTitle": "General Security Concepts",
    "number": 29,
    "prompt": "Brian’s organization uses a process where a secure module boots systems, then monitors them as each boot stage proceeds. It validates each signed boot stage and reports on whether the boot process was correct or not when complete. What is the secure module used to verify these stages called?",
