    "domainTitle": "General Security Concepts",
    "number": 55,
    "prompt": "Yasmine submits the Windows BitLocker key to a central repository after she encryptions the machine. The central repository allows files to be uploaded, but not read, and is protected with access requiring special permissions. What type of solution is Yasmine’s company using?",
