    "domainTitle": "General Security Concepts",
    "number": 96,
    "prompt": "Isaac is concerned that the passwords that his users are creating are too short and can be easily brute-forced if their hashes were compromised. Rather than make his users remember longer passwords, he would like to implement a technical solution to help make the hashes more resistant to cracking. What solution can he use to help with this?",
