    "explanationEn": "The primary concern for security professionals around legacy hardware is their lack of patches and updates, meaning that security fixes and updates will not exist. While the hardware could fail, that would typically lead to replacement with more modern, supportable options and is a concern for the system administrators and owners. Lack of vendor support and inability to support modern protocols are primarily concerns for owners and system administrators."
