    "domainTitle": "Threats, Vulnerabilities, and Mitigations",
    "number": 21,
    "prompt": "Coleen is the web security administrator for an online auction website. A small number of users are complaining that when they visit the website it does not appear to be the correct site. Coleen checks and she can visit the site without any problem, even from computers outside the network. She also checks the web server log and there is no record of those users ever connecting. Which of the following might best explain this?",
