    "domain": "2",
    "domainTitle": "Threats, Vulnerabilities, and Mitigations",
    "number": 182,
    "prompt": "Dan was recently troubleshooting a web server and deployed a firewall rule to his organization’s datacenter firewall at the beginning of the ruleset. The rule reads: ALLOW FROM ANY:TCP 80 TO ANY:ANY What type of vulnerability should the security team at Dan’s workplace label this as?",
