    "domain": "3",
    "domainTitle": "Security Architecture",
    "number": 16,
    "prompt": "Devin is building a cloud system and wants to ensure that it can adapt to changes in its workload by provisioning or deprovisioning resources automatically. His goal is to ensure that the environment is not overprovisioned or underprovisioned and that he is efficiently spending money on his infrastructure. What concept describes this?",
