    "domainTitle": "Security Architecture",
    "number": 67,
    "prompt": "Dani wants to protect HTTP traffic that is sent from SCADA devices on her network to a cloud-hosted controller. The devices don’t natively support an HTTPS connection. What could she do to transparently protect the data?",
