    "domainTitle": "Security Operations",
    "number": 21,
    "prompt": "Angela wants to ensure that IoT devices in her organization have a secure configuration when they are deployed and that they are ready for further configuration for their specific purposes. What term is used to describe these standard configurations used as part of her configuration management program?",
