    "domainTitle": "Security Operations",
    "number": 66,
    "prompt": "Nathan needs to know how many times an event occurred and wants to check a log file for that event. Which of the following grep commands will tell him how many times the event happened if each occurrence is logged independently in the logfile.txt log file, and uses a unique event ID, event101?",
