    "domainTitle": "Security Operations",
    "number": 110,
    "prompt": "Juan’s team is in charge of responding to potential phishing attacks and advertises an infosec@example.com email address to his organization to send examples of potential phishing attacks to. Which of the following is not a benefit Juan’s team would get from automating the creation of tickets in their support tool based on these emails?",
