    "explanationEn": "Using threat data from reputation tools will best fit Selah’s needs. Agent-based web filtering is used when systems will be mobile or connected to networks that are not controlled centrally. Centralized web filtering proxies and URL scanning are useful general controls, but reputation tools answer the specific need more directly."
