    "domain": "5",
    "domainTitle": "Security Program Management and Oversight",
    "number": 120,
    "prompt": "Juan is responsible for incident response at a large financial institution. He discovers that the company Wi-Fi has been breached. The attacker used the same login credentials that ship with the wireless access point (WAP). The attacker was able to use those credentials to access the WAP administrative console and make changes. Which of the following best describes the lack of standards or procedures that caused this vulnerability to exist?",
