    "domainTitle": "Security Program Management and Oversight",
    "number": 125,
    "prompt": "Gurvinder’s corporate datacenter is located in an area that FEMA has identified as being part of a 100-year flood plain. He knows that there is a chance in any given year that his datacenter could be completely flooded and underwater, and he wants to ensure that his organization knows what to do if that happens. What type of plan should he write?",
