    "number": 171,
    "prompt": "Olivia’s cloud service provider claims to provide zero data loss from storage, and Olivia’s company wants to take advantage of that service because loss of data would be extremely costly for the business. What business agreement can Oliva put in place to help ensure that the reliability that the vendor advertises is maintained?",
