    "domain": "5",
    "domainTitle": "Security Program Management and Oversight",
    "number": 202,
    "prompt": "Mark is responsible for the execution of his organization’s security awareness program. Why might he deploy multiple training methods like workshops, online training, and simulations as part of the training?",
