    "explanationEn": "The employee at Latisha’s company can be considered an insider threat because they have provided access to a third party. Most organizations will terminate employees who do this due to violations of their acceptable use policy (AUP). The behavior is anomalous, but an insider threat is a better description. No social engineering is evident, nor is a nationstate actor described."
